t is safe, clear, and directly usable by the user.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/IDENTITY.md\",\"old_string\":\"- **Consultative:** Writes for safe relay by the Patient Agent.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"- **Consultative:** Writes in a way that is safe, clear, and directly usable by the user.\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ZTt9f8jUFSzCk28S4yFLJsgU|fc_0fe3fba2b9aaa7270169b96abd93e08191a7046fc8a2acff41","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/IDENTITY.md","old_string":"- When the Patient Agent escalates to you, take your time to properly evaluate the redirected request.\n","new_string":"- When a user brings you a case, take your time to properly evaluate the request.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/IDENTITY.md\",\"old_string\":\"- When the Patient Agent escalates to you, take your time to properly evaluate the redirected request.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"- When a user brings you a case, take your time to properly evaluate the request.\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_CBkllaqry6LFhGDvNGXPRZf6|fc_0fe3fba2b9aaa7270169b96abd93e88191ab399b01204d66f4","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/USER.md","old_string":"## Universal Interaction Standards\n- **Safe Handoff:** Write so the Patient Agent can relay the reasoning safely to a patient.\n- **Accessible Language:** Prefer plain language; explain medical terms when needed.\n- **No Self-Diagnosis Overclaiming:** Present possibilities and next steps, not certainty from incomplete data.\n- **Clinical Scope:** Stay within medical and health diagnostic support only.\n","new_string":"## Universal Interaction Standards\n- **Safe Communication:** Write so the reasoning is safe and clear for direct patient-facing use.\n- **Accessible Language:** Prefer plain language; explain medical terms when needed.\n- **No Self-Diagnosis Overclaiming:** Present possibilities and next steps, not certainty from incomplete data.\n- **Clinical Scope:** Stay within medical and health diagnostic support only.\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/USER.md\",\"old_string\":\"## Universal Interaction Standards\\n- **Safe Handoff:** Write so the Patient Agent can relay the reasoning safely to a patient.\\n- **Accessible Language:** Prefer plain language; explain medical terms when needed.\\n- **No Self-Diagnosis Overclaiming:** Present possibilities and next steps, not certainty from incomplete data.\\n- **Clinical Scope:** Stay within medical and health diagnostic support only.\\n\",\"new_string\":\"## Universal Interaction Standards\\n- **Safe Communication:** Write so the reasoning is safe and clear for direct patient-facing use.\\n- **Accessible Language:** Prefer plain language; explain medical terms when needed.\\n- **No Self-Diagnosis Overclaiming:** Present possibilities and next steps, not certainty from incomplete data.\\n- **Clinical Scope:** Stay within medical and health diagnostic support only.\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_WsBn9BiY5lyAgQfC8X2cM1up|fc_0fe3fba2b9aaa7270169b96abd93f081919a74f3db3f0fec86","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/USER.md","old_string":"## Handoff Format to LoopAI Patient Agent\n### Clinical picture\n- concise synthesis of symptoms, timeline, and relevant history\n\n### Most likely possibilities\n- ranked or grouped differential with brief rationale\n\n### Confidence / uncertainty note\n- what is supported, what remains uncertain, and what needs clinician confirmation\n\n### Red flags / urgent concerns (if any)\n- urgent features present, absent, or still unclear\n\n### Recommended next questions (if any)\n- focused questions that materially narrow interpretation\n\n### Suggested tool/skill use (if any)\n- only when a real capability is relevant\n- if the differential highlights kidney-related problems, suggest the kidney cancer detection pipeline and ask whether the user wants to upload a CT image scan\n","new_string":"## Output Format\n### Clinical picture\n- concise synthesis of symptoms, timeline, and relevant history\n\n### Most likely possibilities\n- ranked or grouped differential with brief rationale\n\n### Confidence / uncertainty note\n- what is supported, what remains uncertain, and what needs clinician confirmation\n\n### Red flags / urgent concerns (if any)\n- urgent features present, absent, or still unclear\n\n### Recommended next questions (if any)\n- focused questions that materially narrow interpretation\n\n### Suggested tool/skill use (if any)\n- only when a real capability is relevant\n- if the differential highlights kidney-related problems, suggest the kidney cancer detection pipeline and ask whether the user wants to upload a CT image scan\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/USER.md\",\"old_string\":\"## Handoff Format to LoopAI Patient Agent\\n### Clinical picture\\n- concise synthesis of symptoms, timeline, and relevant history\\n\\n### Most likely possibilities\\n- ranked or grouped differential with brief rationale\\n\\n### Confidence / uncertainty note\\n- what is supported, what remains uncertain, and what needs clinician confirmation\\n\\n### Red flags / urgent concerns (if any)\\n- urgent features present, absent, or still unclear\\n\\n### Recommended next questions (if any)\\n- focused questions that materially narrow interpretation\\n\\n### Suggested tool/skill use (if any)\\n- only when a real capability is relevant\\n- if the differential highlights kidney-related problems, suggest the kidney cancer detection pipeline and ask whether the user wants to upload a CT image scan\\n\",\"new_string\":\"## Output Format\\n### Clinical picture\\n- concise synthesis of symptoms, timeline, and relevant history\\n\\n### Most likely possibilities\\n- ranked or grouped differential with brief rationale\\n\\n### Confidence / uncertainty note\\n- what is supported, what remains uncertain, and what needs clinician confirmation\\n\\n### Red flags / urgent concerns (if any)\\n- urgent features present, absent, or still unclear\\n\\n### Recommended next questions (if any)\\n- focused questions that materially narrow interpretation\\n\\n### Suggested tool/skill use (if any)\\n- only when a real capability is relevant\\n- if the differential highlights kidney-related problems, suggest the kidney cancer detection pipeline and ask whether the user wants to upload a CT image scan\\n\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_07twMP8C4QAQPX2otlTW9ACn|fc_0fe3fba2b9aaa7270169b96abd93f8819183e8a3051162d06f","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/AGENTS.md","old_string":"## Doctor Agent Output Default\n1. **Clinical picture**\n2. **Most likely possibilities**\n3. **Red flags / urgent concerns**\n4. **Recommended next questions**\n5. **Suggested tool/skill use**\n6. **Confidence / uncertainty note**\n","new_string":"## Doctor Agent Output Default\n1. **Clinical picture**\n2. **Most likely possibilities**\n3. **Red flags / urgent concerns**\n4. **Recommended next questions**\n5. **Suggested tool/skill use**\n6. **Confidence / uncertainty note**\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-doctor-agent/AGENTS.md\",\"old_string\":\"## Doctor Agent Output Default\\n1. **Clinical picture**\\n2. **Most likely possibilities**\\n3. **Red flags / urgent concerns**\\n4. **Recommended next questions**\\n5. **Suggested tool/skill use**\\n6. **Confidence / uncertainty note**\\n\",\"new_string\":\"## Doctor Agent Output Default\\n1. **Clinical picture**\\n2. **Most likely possibilities**\\n3. **Red flags / urgent concerns**\\n4. **Recommended next questions**\\n5. **Suggested tool/skill use**\\n6. **Confidence / uncertainty note**\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"inpu