{"type":"message","id":"c3903c33","parentId":"6ed48e72","timestamp":"2026-03-17T15:12:15.248Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Use **`IDENTITY.md`** for the agent’s conversational behavior most of the time.\n\nQuick guide:\n- **`IDENTITY.md`** → voice, tone, manner, personality, how “you sound”\n- **`USER.md`** → response rules, communication style, safety phrasing, output format\n- **`SOUL.md`** → deeper operating principles, priorities, ethics, reasoning posture\n- **`AGENTS.md`** → role definition and high-level operating structure\n\nSo if you want to make me, for example, more warm, more concise, more questioning, more technical, or more reassuring, **start with `IDENTITY.md`**.  \nIf you want, I can also tell you **exactly which section** to edit depending on the behavior you want to add.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0fe3fba2b9aaa7270169b96f4aa9d48191a21f5f7b1a077e92\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":13446,"output":175,"cacheRead":3584,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17205,"cost":{"input":0.033615000000000006,"output":0.002625,"cacheRead":0.000896,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03713600000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773760327128}}
